  "explanation_text": "\n$\\sin^{-1}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}}=\\tan^{-1}\\frac{1}{2}$ (tan = $\\frac{1/\\sqrt{5}}{2/\\sqrt{5}}=\\frac{1}{2}$); $\\cot^{-1}3=\\tan^{-1}\\frac{1}{3}$।\nসমষ্টি $=\\tan^{-1}\\frac{1}{2}+\\tan^{-1}\\frac{1}{3}=\\tan^{-1}\\left(\\frac{1/2+1/3}{1-1/6}\\right)=\\tan^{-1}1=\\frac{\\pi}{4}$।\n∴ $4\\times\\frac{\\pi}{4}=\\pi$।\n\nব্যাখ্যা: ভেতরের যোগফল $\\frac{\\pi}{4}$; ৪ গুণে π।\n"
