  "answer_text": "$\\frac{\\pi}{2}$",
  "explanation_text": "\n$A=\\sin^{-1}(\\sqrt{2}\\sin\\theta)$, $B=\\sin^{-1}\\sqrt{\\cos2\\theta}$ (sinθ≥0 ধরে):\n$\\sin A=\\sqrt{2}\\sin\\theta$, $\\sin B=\\sqrt{\\cos2\\theta}=\\sqrt{1-2\\sin^{2}\\theta}$ ⇒ $\\cos A=\\sin B$।\n∴ $B=\\frac{\\pi}{2}-A$ ⇒ $A+B=\\frac{\\pi}{2}$।\n\nব্যাখ্যা: $\\cos A=\\sin B$; সমষ্টি $\\frac{\\pi}{2}$।\n"
 },
 "b7043be4-cc63-4336-a872-62f0d3dacfba": {
